Package: DEGinsight
Title: LLM-Assisted Pathway and Mechanism Interpretation of Bulk RNA-seq
    Differential Expression Results
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person(given = "omixcore",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "1264284076@qq.com")
Description: Interprets differential gene expression results with pathway
    enrichment and large language models (LLMs). Supports directional
    over-representation analysis and preranked gene set enrichment analysis.
    Prompts provide pathway statistics and genes to OpenAI-compatible models.
    The package checks reported pathway names and driver genes against the
    supplied evidence, reports agreement across models, and renders HTML
    reports of proposed mechanisms.
